    {
      "id": "claim_6bf4dac9bbf745c683e07811493d8ca8",
      "statement": "A product is uniquely identified by the pair (Manufacturer, ProductCode). Two makers using the same code are two products, not a duplicate. The system flags as 'Duplicate' only rows where both manufacturer and code are identical. This is enforced by productCodes.duplicateProductKeys().",
