    {
      "id": "claim_fcb8bea89eb745f58a43d9312fc20099",
      "statement": "ProductCodeImportScreen is a wizard for bulk product code imports: (1) Upload a spreadsheet with codes and optional positions/manufacturers/descriptions; (2) Split multi-code cells; (3) Map codes to positions by ref or description match; (4) Review which codes have ETs (green), are new (blue), or are ambiguous (yellow); (5) Use BulkCreateETModal to propose ETs for new codes, optionally filling manufacturers from the import; (6) Compare the new codes against Forms to surface recipe changes via FormDiffBlock.",
